<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A1.F7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">FontBench sample gallery.<span id="A1.F7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The four typographic dimensions evaluated: font family (note Arial vs. Helvetica are visually near-identical), font size (12–64pt), font style (regular/bold/italic/bold-italic), and font color. The rightmost column shows a representative question for each dimension.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
