<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Data Generation Details</h3>

<section id="A1.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.1 </span>Generation Algorithm</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.2.1 Generation Algorithm ‣ A.2 Data Generation Details ‣ Appendix A Benchmark Construction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> formalizes the synthetic sample generation procedure.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Synthetic Sample Generation</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                
                
               Font registry <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math>, text corpus <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, target count <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, difficulty distribution <math id="alg1.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                
                
               Sample set <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
               Initialize <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample difficulty <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\sim\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\sim\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample script <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> according to difficulty-script distribution

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample font <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f\sim\mathcal{F}[s]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f\sim\mathcal{F}[s]</annotation></semantics></math> respecting difficulty constraints

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample text <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\sim\mathcal{T}[s]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\sim\mathcal{T}[s]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample size <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\in\{12,16,20,24,32,40,48,64\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\in\{12,16,20,24,32,40,48,64\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample style <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y\in\{\text{regular},\text{bold},\text{italic},\text{bold\_italic}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>regular</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>bold</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>italic</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>bold_italic</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y\in\{\text{regular},\text{bold},\text{italic},\text{bold\_italic}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                
                
                Sample color <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\in\{\text{black},\text{red},\text{blue},\text{green},\ldots\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>black</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>red</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>blue</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>green</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\{\text{black},\text{red},\text{blue},\text{green},\ldots\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                
                Compute background color <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> ensuring contrast with <math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                
                
                Render image <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math> with parameters <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(f,t,z,y,c,b)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(f,t,z,y,c,b)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                
                
                Generate questions <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> for each property

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\mathcal{S}\cup\{(I,Q,\text{metadata})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>metadata</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\mathcal{S}\cup\{(I,Q,\text{metadata})\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.2 </span>Font Size and Color Configuration</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tables <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.2.2 Font Size and Color Configuration ‣ A.2 Data Generation Details ‣ Appendix A Benchmark Construction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.2.2 Font Size and Color Configuration ‣ A.2 Data Generation Details ‣ Appendix A Benchmark Construction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> specify the eight font sizes and eight text colors used in the benchmark.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A1.T5.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:165.6pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.T5.fig1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="A1.T5.fig1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Font size configuration.</span></figcaption>
