<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.1 Model List ‣ Appendix B Evaluation Setup" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> summarizes all 15 VLMs evaluated in this work. The selection covers ten open-source models from four providers and five closed-source commercial APIs, spanning parameter counts from 7B to 72B and including both dense and mixture-of-experts architectures.</p>
