<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Implementation Details</h3>

<section id="A2.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.1 </span>Image Rendering</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Images are rendered using Python’s Pillow library. Each image is PNG-format RGB with anti-aliasing enabled, 96 DPI, and a background color sampled to ensure a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1 with the text color. Canvas size is dynamically computed from text bounding-box bounds with 20 px padding on all sides.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.2 </span>API Configuration</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All models are accessed with temperature 0, <span id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max_tokens</span> 100, and default sampling parameters (<span id="A2.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">top_p</span> 1.0, no frequency or presence penalties).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.3 </span>Prompt Template</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="209.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 209.52" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,209.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;" fill="#BFBFBF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 203.61 C 0 206.87 2.64 209.52 5.91 209.52 L 471.47 209.52 C 474.73 209.52 477.38 206.87 477.38 203.61 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 185.41 L 475.41 185.41 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 194)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="434.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Evaluation Prompt Template</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.2em;--ltx-fo-height:11.35em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="159.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 157.05)" width="459.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.2em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Look at this image and answer the following
<br class="ltx_break">question.
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.7pt;">
Question: {question}
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.7pt;">
Options:
<br class="ltx_break">A. {option_a}
<br class="ltx_break">B. {option_b}
<br class="ltx_break">C. {option_c}
<br class="ltx_break">D. {option_d}
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.7pt;">
Respond with only the letter (A, B, C, or D)
<br class="ltx_break">of your answer.
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.4 </span>Answer Parsing</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Responses are parsed with the following priority cascade: (1) exact letter match (“A”, “B”, “C”, “D”); (2) letter with surrounding punctuation (“A.”, “(A)”, “A)”); (3) first valid letter appearing in the response; (4) full option-text match. Responses that fail all four steps are marked incorrect.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Compute Resources</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All evaluations consist of 1,000 API calls per model (250 samples <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 4 questions). Total wall-clock time ranged from approximately 10 minutes (Qwen2.5-VL-7B via local inference) to 161 minutes (GLM-4.5V) depending on API latency. No GPU is required for evaluation; all inference runs on the respective model providers’ infrastructure.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Complete Results and Statistical Analysis</h2>

