<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Statistical Analysis</h3>

<section id="A3.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">C.2.1 </span>Confidence Intervals</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compute 95% confidence intervals using the Wilson score interval for binomial proportions (<math id="A3.SS2.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n{=}1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n{=}1000</annotation></semantics></math> questions per model).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A3.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Overall accuracy with 95% confidence intervals (<math id="A3.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n{=}1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n{=}1000</annotation></semantics></math> questions per model).</span></figcaption>
